        "altText": "Illustration of a person resting on a gym floor",
        "caption": "Making time for rest after activity"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c14spbt7kk318",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c14n7",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "Some small studies have examined post-exercise soreness. Feeling less sore is different from proving faster tissue repair or better athletic performance. Massage also should not be explained as flushing out lactic acid.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c14s8",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c14n8",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "What about immunity?",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c14s9",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c14n9",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "Research measuring short-term immune markers is not the same as research showing fewer infections. We therefore describe massage around comfort and relaxation rather than claiming it boosts protection against illness.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c14s10",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c14n10",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "Make the appointment useful to you",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c14s11",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c14n11",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "Before your visit, choose one or two priorities. During the session, speak up about temperature, pressure and positioning. Afterward, notice comfort and everyday function rather than expecting a specific laboratory or hormone change. Discuss persistent symptoms with your healthcare professional.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
